{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"网络科学应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-network-analysis","title":"社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/social-network-analysis","wordCount":1809,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"biological-networks","title":"生物网络（Biological Networks）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/biological-networks","wordCount":1854,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"technological-networks","title":"技术网络（Technological Networks）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/technological-networks","wordCount":1978,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"网络科学应用\">网络科学应用</h1><p>网络科学的力量在于其跨学科通用性：同一套度量、模型与算法框架可以分析社交关系、蛋白质交互、互联网路由。本章选取三个最成熟的应用领域——社会网络、生物网络、技术网络——展示网络视角如何产生传统方法无法获得的洞察。</p>\n<p>每个领域有其特有的数据获取方式、噪声特征与问题关切，但底层的分析管道高度一致：数据采集与清洗、拓扑特征提取、社区与角色识别、动力学建模与预测。理解这种统一性是网络科学作为独立学科的核心价值主张。</p>\n<p>相关文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"social-network-analysis\">社会网络分析</a> — 强弱连接、结构洞、影响力传播、在线社交平台</li>\n<li><a href=\"biological-networks\">生物网络</a> — 蛋白质交互、代谢网络、基因调控、网络医学</li>\n<li><a href=\"technological-networks\">技术网络</a> — 互联网拓扑、电力网格、交通网络、供应链</li>\n</ul>\n"}